    },
    {
      "id": "cell-48",
      "source": "<p>Let’s now plot the cross-validated performance of an SGDRegressor model with L1 regularization (\\(R^{2}\\)) across the different \\(\\alpha\\) values:</p>\n",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "editable": false,
        "collapsed": false
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cell-49",
      "source": [
        "fig,ax = plt.subplots(figsize=(10,5))\n",
        "\n",
        "ax.plot(logalphas, cross_validated_r2, label=\"cross-validated r2\")\n",
        "ax.scatter([bestLogAlpha] , [bestR2_valid], c=\"red\")\n",
        "\n",
        "for i,scores in enumerate(fold_r2s):\n",
        "    ax.plot(logalphas, scores, label=f\"fold {i}\", linestyle=\"dotted\")\n",
