    {
      "id": "cell-16",
      "source": "<p>We would like now to extract 1,000 random sequences of a length 100 bases from the downloaded genome:</p>\n",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "editable": false,
        "collapsed": false
