n ready figures:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Define the size of the figure</li>\n<li>Choose to project data on a different projection.</li>\n<li>Add coastline</li>\n<li>Set the min and max values for plotting</li>\n<li>Add a title, change colorbar title</li>\n<li>Save figure into png</li>\n</ul>\n",
