r day, which patient had the maximum value.\" width=\"751\" height=\"477\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n<p>To support this functionality, most array functions allow us to specify the axis we want to work on. If we ask for the average across axis 0 (rows in our 2D example), we get:</p>\n",
