    {
      "id": "cell-28",
      "source": "<p>As a quick check, we can ask this array what its shape is:</p>\n",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "editable": false,
        "collapsed": false
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cell-29",
