    {
      "id": "cell-32",
      "source": "<p>It’s a good exercise to rewrite <code style=\"color: inherit\">sixpack</code> in a very simplified version without most of the features in sixpack:</p>\n",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "editable": false,
