        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cell-70",
      "source": "<p>For dictionaries, it’s essentially the same, we access the ‘place’ in the dictionary just like we did with a list, and set it to a value</p>\n",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "editable": false,
        "collapsed": false
