          "id": ""
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cell-50",
      "source": "<p>The return value of <code style=\"color: inherit\">update_</code> methods is usually a dictionary with detailed info about the updated resource.</p>\n<p>Finally to <strong>delete</strong> a resource, use the <code style=\"color: inherit\">delete_</code> method, e.g.:</p>\n",
