        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cell-84",
      "source": "<p>The return value of <code style=\"color: inherit\">update()</code> methods is the updated object.</p>\n<p>Finally to <strong>delete</strong> a resource, you can use the <code style=\"color: inherit\">delete()</code> method of the object, e.g.:</p>\n",
