      "id": "cell-28",
      "source": "<h2 id=\"analysing-the-plots\">Analysing the plots</h2>\n<p>That’s a lot of information! Let’s attack this in sections and see what questions these plots can help us answer.</p>\n<blockquote class=\"question\" style=\"border: 2px solid #8A9AD0; margin: 1em 0.2em\">\n<div class=\"box-title question-title\" id=\"question-batch-variation\"><i class=\"far fa-question-circle\" aria-hidden=\"true\" ></i> Question: Batch Variation</div>\n<p>Are there differences in sequencing depth across the samples?</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Which plot(s) addresses this?</li>\n<li>How do you interpret it?</li>\n</ol>\n<br/><details style=\"border: 2px solid #B8C3EA; margin: 1em 0.2em;padding: 0.5em; cursor: pointer;\"><summary>👁 View solution</summary>\n<div class=\"box-title solution-title\" id=\"solution-1\"><button class=\"gtn-boxify-button solution\" type=\"button\" aria-controls=\"solution-1\" aria-expanded=\"true\"><i class=\"far fa-eye\" aria-hidden=\"true\" ></i> <span>Solution</span><span class=\"fold-unfold fa fa-minus-square\"></span></button></div>\n<ol>\n<li>The plot <code style=\"color: inherit\">violin - batch - log</code> will have what you’re looking for!\n<figure id=\"figure-1\" style=\"max-width: 90%;\"><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAABTsAAAD/CAMAAAAJ1fJhAAAAclBMVEX///+C\nW1T6+/pWUFdCOz0PDQ2RdK4DAQL//vwyMjI7kjsnIyPSh7wmDAkyc6C9PT25\nubjhgSuDf4Xs7OxtZmn29vXe3d2hoaEqRjhvRjsIHRrPzs5YLR+UkZE6W0+k\nT0ZAbItKhkrRhkSCc3G6f06re5zERFXmAAAACXBIWXMAAA7zAAAO8wEcU5k6\nAAAgAElEQVR42uxdDYPatrYESQ5SFHpVS7YBYzYJ2///F98cyTY22Ebat2y3\nG3hNetMX1mBZo/MxZ2a1SnjJVbF6vh78Yl/yUs/Xc0X/6Fssn3fu8a/nTX6+\nnq+vh57Pff0xC/MMH55H4TPs/Kw7VD5X5pl4PV9PmH6+PuT1LHZ+0AZ4gufz\n9Xx9nUPqCZyfOSV4BinPFx6d5yb9pC/7vAUfEtx/XMXzuaJf6y7L54p+ziW1\nSqvn6+GvrMAW+JigsNBaPG/4o19aFx8Gney5RT9kSVUxn81N7l31JxQy/vVU\nVn1EJ0r+MSv6CSoU6gN7i3/Oin7QI8NSlpSxP3RdpPwURV31Ra/1L6Mm+2or\n2p8Gkg3+8MTO97zFLHVJ2dx5rZ4N7v/mTpOjxf0zoxT5VU9D+cedhquPIgrK\n1CVlg+Cz+IPWRX6S9rP6QNRQT+rCfxg75cS3e2LnO99e+YYltX/eTpPsMzB