    },
    {
      "id": "cell-70",
      "source": "<p>If you are working on your own data and it’s not mouse data, you can check available datasets for other species and just use relevant dataset in <code style=\"color: inherit\">useMart()</code> function.</p>\n",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
