a><br /><br /><figcaption><span class=\"figcaption-prefix\"><strong>Figure 1</strong>:</span> Two ways of switching kernel.</figcaption></figure>\n<p>Now, when we are in the R environment, let’s install the packages required for this part - <code style=\"color: inherit\">tximeta</code> and <code style=\"color: inherit\">DropletUtils</code>:</p>\n",
