          ],
          "id": ""
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cell-92",
      "source": "<p>The above functions will export your object and the plot into your Galaxy history from which you may download, share, and analyze!</p>\n<p>Congratulations! You have interpreted your scRNA-seq data in several important ways!</p>\n",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "editable": false,
        "collapsed": false
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "id": "final-ending-cell",
      "metadata": {
        "editable": false,
        "collapsed": false
      },
      "source": [
